{"audit_run_id":"audit:1bdda2c7a1564fadbf615f4af6a0e3cd","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":22,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"| File | What it is |"},{"end_column":14,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"| --- | --- |"},{"end_column":139,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"| `make_data.py` | Deterministic seeded Python generator. Running it writes `guinea_pig_hay_study.csv`. Same seed, same file every time. |"},{"end_column":104,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"| `guinea_pig_hay_study.csv` | The analysis input. One row per guinea pig, 34 rows plus a header row. |"},{"end_column":79,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"One row is one guinea pig: a single adult animal from a single household, with"},{"end_column":76,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"its feeding treatment and its six end-of-study measurements after the eight"},{"end_column":74,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"week feeding period. Each animal appears exactly once. There are no blank"},{"end_column":49,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"cells; every animal has a value in every column."},{"end_column":79,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"The file has 8 columns: the animal identifier, the feeding treatment, and then"},{"end_column":67,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"the six protocol outcomes in the order the protocol declared them."},{"end_column":34,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| Column | Unit | What it holds |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":114,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `animal_id` | none (text label) | Study identifier for the animal, `GP01` through `GP34`. Unique across rows. |"},{"end_column":214,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| `group` | none (text label) | Feeding treatment. Exactly two possible entries: `hay_rack` for long-stem hay from an open rack, `forage_block` for the same hay compressed into forage blocks. 17 animals in each. |"},{"end_column":127,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| `hay_intake_g_day` | grams per day | Declared outcome 1. Daily hay dry matter intake, averaged over the two recorded days. |"},{"end_column":130,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"| `body_weight_g` | grams | Declared outcome 2. Body weight at the end of the eight weeks, recorded at the sedated examination. |"},{"end_column":122,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"| `faecal_output_g_day` | grams per day | Declared outcome 3. Daily faecal output, averaged over the two recorded days. |"},{"end_column":140,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"| `faecal_particle_mm` | millimetres | Declared outcome 4. Median faecal particle size, a marker of how finely the animal chewed its hay. |"},{"end_column":121,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"| `chewing_min_day` | minutes per day | Declared outcome 5. Time spent chewing, scored from video of one recorded day. |"},{"end_column":124,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"| `occlusal_angle_deg` | degrees | Declared outcome 6. Cheek tooth occlusal angle, measured on the intraoral photographs. |"},{"end_column":31,"end_line":33,"start_column":1,"start_line":33,"text":"| Column | Minimum | Maximum |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":35,"start_column":1,"start_line":35,"text":"| `hay_intake_g_day` | 36.1 | 73.4 |"},{"end_column":33,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"| `body_weight_g` | 710 | 1194 |"},{"end_column":40,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"| `faecal_output_g_day` | 27.3 | 59.0 |"},{"end_column":39,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"| `faecal_particle_mm` | 0.52 | 1.41 |"},{"end_column":34,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"| `chewing_min_day` | 110 | 244 |"},{"end_column":39,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"| `occlusal_angle_deg` | 23.5 | 37.9 |"},{"end_column":80,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"The weight column deliberately includes animals at both the light and the heavy"},{"end_column":58,"end_line":43,"start_column":1,"start_line":43,"text":"end of the adult range, not only animals near the middle."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":47,"start_column":1,"start_line":47,"text":"`make_data.py` draws each animal's values from a fixed seed (`SEED = 20260826`)"},{"end_column":79,"end_line":48,"start_column":1,"start_line":48,"text":"using the Python standard library `random` module, so the CSV is reproducible."},{"end_column":78,"end_line":49,"start_column":1,"start_line":49,"text":"Treatment labels are shuffled across the 34 animal identifiers, 17 per group."},{"end_column":75,"end_line":50,"start_column":1,"start_line":50,"text":"Within an animal, daily hay intake rises slightly with body weight, faecal"},{"end_column":75,"end_line":51,"start_column":1,"start_line":51,"text":"output tracks intake, and chewing time rises with the amount of hay worked"},{"end_column":75,"end_line":52,"start_column":1,"start_line":52,"text":"through, so the columns carry the correlations a real feeding record would"},{"end_column":80,"end_line":53,"start_column":1,"start_line":53,"text":"carry. Draws that fall outside the plausible range for a measurement are placed"},{"end_column":54,"end_line":54,"start_column":1,"start_line":54,"text":"a small random distance back inside the nearer limit."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:50f7553e3755e6e78c3c","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:0d01cfefd790b707d215bd9a72adad6c897d867b30d6d4ca0cc4d2db9ae7bd31","end_line":54,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-54","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:1bdda2c7a1564fadbf615f4af6a0e3cd","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":97,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `group` column of `guinea_pig_hay_study.csv`."},{"end_column":169,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: hay_intake_g_day, body_weight_g, faecal_output_g_day, faecal_particle_mm, chewing_min_day, occlusal_angle_deg."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:385f99d2c932faec3a6b","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:d0932e693cee0a974e78274206e92a47a6cb23b2ab8fa286f72020a06ebd62a8","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
